        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 24 at 6:58AM AKDT until September 27 at 4:00AM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Southeast winds 30 to 40 mph with gusts up to 60 mph
expected.

* WHERE...Windy Pass.

* WHEN...From midnight tonight to 4 AM AKDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds could blow around unsecured objects. Travel
could be difficult, especially for high profile vehicles.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Winds may decrease slightly Saturday afternoon
and evening before increasing briefly overnight into early Sunday.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
